  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #76CD00;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size23\">개인 Open API 허브를 구축해보았습니다.^^</span></span></b><br>&#160;<br><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwcu3d848Bhj9FoyHNbS062A0cMAuifyrxd7rR74HPPRkVwBNH8W3BBRopzJFxSMXMa/exec\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwcu3d848Bhj9FoyHNbS062A0cMAuifyrxd7rR74HPPRkVwBNH8W3BBRopzJFxSMXMa/exec</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"승윤과학이 운영하는 개인 API HUB\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"script.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwcu3d848Bhj9FoyHNbS062A0cMAuifyrxd7rR74HPPRkVwBNH8W3BBRopzJFxSMXMa/exec\" data-og-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwcu3d848Bhj9FoyHNbS062A0cMAuifyrxd7rR74HPPRkVwBNH8W3BBRopzJFxSMXMa/exec\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwcu3d848Bhj9FoyHNbS062A0cMAuifyrxd7rR74HPPRkVwBNH8W3BBRopzJFxSMXMa/exec\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwcu3d848Bhj9FoyHNbS062A0cMAuifyrxd7rR74HPPRkVwBNH8W3BBRopzJFxSMXMa/exec\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">승윤과학이 운영하는 개인 API HUB</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">script.google.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">위 링크 입니다.</span></b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cd26f83f2e61f82e9b369344864bb9d418d16ed1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cd26f83f2e61f82e9b369344864bb9d418d16ed1\" data-origin-width=\"664\" data-origin-height=\"170\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #FF0010;\">먼저 API 키 신규 발급 받기</span></b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3950f91ce25ad672bd4a4938396e11a90d18015a\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3950f91ce25ad672bd4a4938396e11a90d18015a\" data-origin-width=\"860\" data-origin-height=\"858\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">입력창을 채우고 발급받기 버튼을 누르면<br>API키가 발급이 됩니다.<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #FF0010;\">발급 받은 API키를 가지고, API 사용 가이드로 가셔서<br>사용법을 보시면 됩니다</span></b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6df0f3d042b117c3165e71b67b65907e74e510f2\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"278\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6df0f3d042b117c3165e71b67b65907e74e510f2\" data-origin-width=\"278\" data-origin-height=\"90\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bb0e498bb3cd598e52d63b5230106ebbb969d436\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bb0e498bb3cd598e52d63b5230106ebbb969d436\" data-origin-width=\"905\" data-origin-height=\"554\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">현재는 2개 빅데이터만 넣어두었습니다.<br>&#160;<br>아래는 그 중 연평균 각종 기상데이터 설명</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/28602acf34ff4dff6eec8dcbaa630eadf7e24171\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/28602acf34ff4dff6eec8dcbaa630eadf7e24171\" data-origin-width=\"607\" data-origin-height=\"824\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">가이드를 따라 데이터를 사용하실 수 있습니다.</span><br>&#160;<br>즉,<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">전국 도시 월평균 각종 기상데이터</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">전국 도시 연평균 각종 기상데이터 를</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">API키를 통해 추출 활용하실 수 있습니다.</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #FF0010;\">테스트로</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #FF0010;\">제가 제공하는 API키를 제가 발급 받아서 만든 웹앱(앱스크립트)입니다</span></b><br><b><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycby5U7MolI-TOV9-BjAu9UFzGNL0rEBUndMP2mvn5-x2uH9BfFXakjkurpRdO0hly4DbZw/exec\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"><span style=\"color: #FF0010;\">https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycby5U7MolI-TOV9-BjAu9UFzGNL0rEBUndMP2mvn5-x2uH9BfFXakjkurpRdO0hly4DbZw/exec</span></a></b></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"전국 연평균 기상 데이터 분석기\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"script.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycby5U7MolI-TOV9-BjAu9UFzGNL0rEBUndMP2mvn5-x2uH9BfFXakjkurpRdO0hly4DbZw/exec\" data-og-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycby5U7MolI-TOV9-BjAu9UFzGNL0rEBUndMP2mvn5-x2uH9BfFXakjkurpRdO0hly4DbZw/exec\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycby5U7MolI-TOV9-BjAu9UFzGNL0rEBUndMP2mvn5-x2uH9BfFXakjkurpRdO0hly4DbZw/exec\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycby5U7MolI-TOV9-BjAu9UFzGNL0rEBUndMP2mvn5-x2uH9BfFXakjkurpRdO0hly4DbZw/exec\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">전국 연평균 기상 데이터 분석기</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">script.google.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">최근 연평균 온도가 많이 올라갔어요 ㅠㅠ</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1b457fc37753331c1275f260b85511c0947fc4ea\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1b457fc37753331c1275f260b85511c0947fc4ea\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"527\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">평균기온이 상승하고 ....있음을...</span><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6de0bcc3ada52d54840c35cd0f8ab78ef2c40106\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6de0bcc3ada52d54840c35cd0f8ab78ef2c40106\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"511\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/20487bde5911ad0b536d17a62e04f40858708f55\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/20487bde5911ad0b536d17a62e04f40858708f55\" data-origin-width=\"980\" data-origin-height=\"870\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">연간 일조량 변화</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
